This is an independent, unofficial collection of agent skills.

Portions of the guidance are adapted and synthesized from Android Developers
mobile UI design documentation, created and shared by Google and the Android
Open Source Project. Source pages are linked in the relevant reference files
and inventoried in docs/coverage.json, reviewed on 2026-10-04.

The adaptation reorganizes design guidance into task-oriented agent workflows,
decision tables, checks, and examples. Authored heuristics and scenarios are
identified in context. This collection does not reproduce the complete manuals.

